# Outfit head (R18): gas mask: face plate, two big glowing eye lenses, a snout with a valve and two steel filter cans
# angled forward and down at the cheeks (the respirator silhouette), accent straps round the back.
# Head frame: the head fills x 1..6, y 2..6, z 0..5 (pivot 3 4 0).
name outfit_gasmask
grid 5
size 10 8 5
slot mask SwatchMain
slot strap SwatchAccent
slot lens SwatchGlow
slot can Steel
box 6 2 0 7 6 4 mask
box 7 3 0 8 5 2 mask
box 8 3 0 9 5 1 can
beam 7.5 2.5 1.2 9.2 0.9 0.5 0.9 can
beam 7.5 5.5 1.2 9.2 7.1 0.5 0.9 can
box 6 2 2 7 3 4 lens
box 6 5 2 7 6 4 lens
box 0 2 3 1 6 4 strap
box 1 1 3 6 2 4 strap
box 1 6 3 6 7 4 strap
pivot 3 4 0
